WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Step 1: On a computer, use the main navigation at the top. Select a feature to open it; Ordering’s related pages open from its menu.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Step 2: On a phone, use Home, Rostering, Comms and Checklists in the bottom bar. Open More for the other features.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Step 3: Open the blue account dropdown for User profile, Dark mode, Help &amp; support and your available Settings.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Step 4: Use browser Back and Forward to return to earlier screens. Save or resolve outstanding changes before leaving an editor.
